 site  No lymph nodes are identified in the axillary end marked by the bow tie  Representative sections are submitted  A B  cavity to deep margin C E  cavity and surrounding parenchyma F  cavity G  uninvolved parenchyma H I  area designated by suture  each block representing a bivalved tissue fragment  J L  three nodules  each bivalved  located between cavity and area designated by stitch Resident  SOHEIL DADRAS  MD  PHD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No_breast_biopsy.
