om the lateral margin  0 2cm from the medial margin  8 0cm from the superior margin  and 1 5cm from the inferior margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is notable for unremarkable fibro  fatty breast tissue  The suspicious area is submitted entirely  Labeled  axillary nodes   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm piece of fibrofatty tissue  The specimen is dissected to reveal nineteen lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 4 0cm in greatest dimension  The cut surfaces range from fleshy tan  to yellow  to white  SECTION CODE  A  superior margin  en face B  inferior margin  en face C  medial margin with mass  radial section D  lateral margin with mass  radial section E  anterior margin  radial section F  posterior margin  radial section G  mass with overlying skin H  mass  representative section I N  breast parenchyma  representative sections O U  axillary lymph nodes Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   LUMPECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  AXILLARY   DISSECTION   report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
