sly identified  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted  Section Code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section of the medial margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity with adjacent hemorrhagic gritty area with closest margin submitted entirely   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibrous tissue away from cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section of the lateral margin  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  left breast final margin medial   are two irregular portions of gray white to tan pink fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  No orientation is provided  Sectioning reveals dense gray white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesion or other gross abnormality  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  left breast final margin superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm aggregate of gray white to tan yellow fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm indurated focally hemorrhagic gray white nodule in one fragment  and a second REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm firm gray white area with hemorrhage and yellow orange discoloration consistent with fat necrosis in a second fragment  The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  left breast final margin lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unremarkable fibrofatty tissue with no orientation  The specimen is submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  left breast final margin inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of firm  gray to tan pink fibrofatty tissue fragments  with no orientation  Sectioning reveals a dense  gray white fibrous cut sur