ted  No orientation is provided  however  orientation can be obtained using the two scars from the previous lumpectomy  The anterior margin is inked blue and the posterior inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm ill defined indurated area of scar tissue surrounded by pink white fibrous tissue which is subadjacent to the 6 o clock scar on the skin  The scar tissue is 3 5cm  3 2cm  4 6cm  26 2cm  9 8cm  and 9 2cm from the posterior  anterior  inferior  superior  lateral  and medial margins respectively  There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm ill defined  indurated area of firm scar tissue surrounded by pink white hemorrhagic fibrous tissue which is subadjacent to the 1 o clock scar on the skin  17cm superior to the previous area of scar tissue  The scar tissue is 1 5cm  3 6cm  5 1cm  11 7cm  13 2cm  and 16 7cm from the posterior  anterior  lateral  medial  superior  and inferior margins  The remaining breast parenchyma contains yellow lobulated fatty tissue  No lymph nodes are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as labeled  A  Posterior margin toward the 6 o clock scar tissue  B  Anterior margin toward the 6 o clock scar tissue  C J  Six o clock scar tissue  K  Posterior margin to 1 o clock scar tissue  L  1 o clock scar tissue  Gross Description by  JANEL M  RENNA Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  SGR                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  Jonathan Michael Winograd  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No_breast_biopsy.
