e white texture  Unremarkable lymph nodes of up to 2 0cm are present in the axillary fat  Section code  A  inferior margin B C  medial margin D  deep margin E G  other sections of firm area H  red biopsy site I J  tissue adjacent to the tumor  I includes inferior margin K  sections of remaining parenchyma including dense white areas  finely pink nodular areas  and punctate yellow foci L R  axillary lymph nodes Labeled  axillary node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fatty aggregate containing a small 0 3cm lymph node  one half in cassette S  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION , No_breast_biopsy.
