OVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of breast tissue  The specimen is oriented by a long suture on its lateral margin and a short suture on its superior margin  Attached is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm ellipse of skin showing a 4 5cm central  healed  surgical scar  The specimen shows a REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm central cavity which is open on its superior aspect  The walls of the cavity are firm with focal  white firm areas  The inner surface is gray tan and focally granular  The wall is REMOVED_DATE from the closest superior margin and 0 8cm from the other margins  The specimen is inked and representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE  F G  Cavity wall with deep margin  H   Cavity wall with superior margin  I   Lateral margin  J   Medial margin  K L  Inferior margin  M   Cavity wall and overlying skin  Resident  SELIM NASSER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT AXILLARY MASS   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA    report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
