 Frozen Section Lab labeled  left axilla sentinel node hot   blue  REMOVED_CASE_ID    is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue containing 1 lymph node  which is bisected and frozen as FX 1  now submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the remaining fibroadipose tissue submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a 19 x 18 x 5cm  simple skin sparing mastectomy specimen with a REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm  ellipse of skin containing the nipple and areola present on the anterior margin  and oriented with a short stitch superior  and a long stitch left lateral  The nipple and areola are both grossly unremarkable  and the anterior margin consists of yellow lobulated adipose tissue  which is now inked blue entirely  The posterior margin consists of smooth fascia overlying fibroadipose tissue  and is now inked black  Serial sectioning reveals unremarkable  primarily adipose tissue throughout most of the breast  with a more fibrous region diffusely present deep to the nipple  The peripheral tissues are examined for lymph nodes  and a sample node is identified  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior lateral quadrant  representative sections including posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior lateral quadrant  representative sections including posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Superior medial quadrant  representative sections  including fibrous tissue and posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative medial inferior quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections from central fibrous area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lymph node  Received fresh  labeled  right breast additional superficial margin inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  aggregate of fibroadipose tissue which is unoriented  The specimen is serially sectioned  and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right breast   is a 17 x 16 x 6cm  simple skin sparing mastectomy specimen with a REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm area ellipse of skin on the anterior margin  which is oriented with a long stitch right lateral  and a short stitch superior  and contains an unremarkable nipple and areola  The skin surface also extends for a distance of 3cm inferomedial to the areola  A 3cm long linear groove consistent with a prior excision is present on the skin running a distance of 2 5cm along the medial lateral edge of the ellipse  0 1cm from the edge of the skin  1cm from the skin margin in the inferomedial quadrant of the breast is a defect in the anterior margin which measures REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm and shows granularity of the surrounding soft tissue  A cavitary area  consistent with prior excision cavity is seen through this defect  The remaining anterior margin consists of unremarkable yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue  The posterior margin consists of smooth fascia overlying fibroadipose tissue  however  there is a 1 x 1cm defect in the posterior margin in the inferomedial quadrant  which communicates with the previously mentioned cavity  The anterior margin is inked blue and the posterior margin is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm cavity lined by granular yellow pink tissue and with fat necrosis in a patchy distribution within the surrounding breast parenchyma  The biopsy cavity extends to the aforementioned defects in the anterior and posterior margins  The cavity itself extends to approximately 4cm from the nipple  Multiple metal surgical clips are identified in the wall of the cavity  Additional nodules of fat necrosis and focal hemorrhage extend laterally and superiorly for approximately 3cm from the cavity  A firm  punctate red brown 0 2cm lesion with radiating fat necrosis and fibrous tissue over an area of roughly 1 5cm is present 2 5cm superior to the biopsy cavity  The remaining breast parenchyma consists primarily of adipose breast tissue with no focal lesions identified  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of medial portion of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the biopsy cavity to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional section of biopsy cavity to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional section of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of lateral superior portion of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Section including firm hemorrhagic lesion superior to biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Area of fat necrosis superior lateral to biopsy cavity and underlying skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue away from biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 potential lymph nodes  Received fresh  labeled  right breast additional superficial margin superior lateral   are multiple fragments of fibroadipose breast tissue measuring 9 x 5 x 2 5cm in aggregate  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1   LEFT AXILLA SENTINEL NODE   CARCINOMA IS NOT IDENTIFIED  AWAIT SENTINEL NODE WORKUP  Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Monday REMOVED_MONTH 22   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06 56 29PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Lymph Node  Left Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART B  Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy PART C  Breast  Right Additional Superficial Margin Inferior   Excision PART D  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART E  Breast  Right Additional Superficial  Margin Superior Lateral   Excision PART F  Cryo  report_end  , No_breast_biopsy.
