perior and inferior respectively  G  Cavity to overlying skin inferior and deep  H  Cavity to deep  I  Slice 14 to deep  J  Slice 16  K  Slice 17  L  Slice 18  most lateral margin   Gross Description by  JAMES BARRY Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  FCK                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST WITH NIPPLE RIGHT  RE EXCISION , No_breast_biopsy.
