o the deep resection margin  REMOVED_DATE to the superior resection margin  0 3cm to the inferior margin  0 5cm to the lateral margin  and more than 2cm from the medial margin  The remaining parenchyma is unremarkable  Representative sections of the specimen are submitted as follows  SECTION CODES  B D  Lateral resection margin to the firm area  E F  Medial margin entirely submitted  skin included   G N  Sections including firm hard area from medial to lateral  with superior posterior margin in G and K  inferior posterior margin in H and L  superior anterior margin in I and M  and inferior anterior margin in J and N  Resident  DI TIAN  MD  PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL  REMOVED_CASE_ID    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  JACKSON OPERATING ROOM REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   LUMPECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE LEFT SENTINEL  REMOVED_CASE_ID   EXCISION , No_breast_biopsy.
